#. Description of the plugin
#: eg-social-timeline.php
msgid ""
"Unified chronological timeline of your public activity from Mastodon, "
"GoToSocial, Friendica, Bluesky, Pixelfed, PeerTube, Forgejo, Lemmy, "
"ListenBrainz and any RSS or Atom feed. Zero JavaScript, zero tracking."
msgstr ""
"Timeline cronologica unificata delle tue attività pubbliche da Mastodon, "
"GoToSocial, Friendica, Bluesky, Pixelfed, PeerTube, Forgejo, Lemmy, "
"ListenBrainz e qualsiasi feed RSS o Atom. Zero JavaScript, zero tracciamento."

